        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
            Six brand-new 3-bedroom townhomes, designed for life in the heart of Lubbock's Medical District. Steps from UMC, Covenant, and Texas Tech.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-stats">
            <div>
                <span class="stat-num">3 / 2.5</span>
                <span class="stat-label">Bed / Bath</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="stat-num">$2,200</span>
                <span class="stat-label">Per Month</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <span class="stat-num">~$733</span>
                <span class="stat-label">Per Roommate</span>
            </div>
